      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Potential causes for this include having personal space enabled on one of the clients, having the bounding box set incorrectly on one of the avatars' mesh renderers, or general network issues involved with running multiple VRChat instances at the same time using the same Steam account. Ensure personal space is disabled on both clients, try using different avatars, and make sure Steam either isn't running on one or both of the systems or that they're logged into separate accounts on Steam. If the problem persists, contact support@vrchat.com.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
